# Domains (actions/actions_domains.iface.kbd)
**spc + a** -- Actions
**spc + b** -- Bookmarks
**spc + c** -- Calendar
**spc + d** -- Definitions
**spc + e** -- Explorer
**spc + f** -- Filter
**spc + g** -- Git
**spc + h** -- Hyperlinks
**spc + i** -- Info
**spc + j** -- Jumps
**spc + k** -- Keymaps
**spc + l** -- Locations
**spc + m** -- Mem
**spc + n** -- Notebooks
**spc + o** -- Output
**spc + p** -- Properties
**spc + q** -- Quickfix
**spc + r** -- References
**spc + s** -- Symbols
**spc + t** -- Terminal
**spc + u** -- UI
**spc + v** -- Virtualization
**spc + w** -- Warnings
**spc + x** -- Extensions
**spc + y** -- History
**spc + z** -- Tests
**spc + ;** -- Commands
**spc + '** -- Registries
**spc + ,** -- Settings
**spc + .** -- Tags
**spc + /** -- Help
**spc + \** -- Compare
**spc + [** -- Backlinks
**spc + ]** -- Outlinks
**spc + =** -- Format
